      "content": "An upright object is placed at a distance of\n40 cm in front of a convergent lens of focal\nlength 20 cm. A convergent mirror of focal\nlength 10 cm is placed at a distance of 60 cm\non the other side of the lens. The position and\nsize of the final image will be :",
      "options": [
        {
          "identifier": "A",
          "content": "20 cm from the convergent mirror, same\nsize as the object"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "B",
          "content": "40 cm from the convergent mirror, same\nsize as the object"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "C",
          "content": "40 cm from the convergent lens, same\nsize as the object"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "D",
          "content": "20 cm from the convergent mirror, twice the\nsize of the object"
        }
      ],
      "correct_options": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": "<p>In given system of lens and mirror, position of object O in front of lens is at a distance 2f. i.e. u = 2f = 40 cm</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l35inazs/a048151d-56b2-4eba-8b91-8feeb29d77cf/1bc563b0-d353-11ec-ada9-55bd22062331/file-1l35inazv.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l35inazs/a048151d-56b2-4eba-8b91-8feeb29d77cf/1bc563b0-d353-11ec-ada9-55bd22062331/file-1l35inazv.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Main 2019 (Online) 8th April Morning Slot Physics - Geometrical Optics Question 222 English Explanation 1\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1l35inazs/a048151d-56b2-4eba-8b91-8feeb29d77cf/1bc563b0-d353-11ec-ada9-55bd22062331/file-1l35inazv.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l35inazs/a048151d-56b2-4eba-8b91-8feeb29d77cf/1bc563b0-d353-11ec-ada9-55bd22062331/file-1l35inazv.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l35inazs/a048151d-56b2-4eba-8b91-8feeb29d77cf/1bc563b0-d353-11ec-ada9-55bd22062331/file-1l35inazv.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l35inazs/a048151d-56b2-4eba-8b91-8feeb29d77cf/1bc563b0-d353-11ec-ada9-55bd22062331/file-1l35inazv.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l35inazs/a048151d-56b2-4eba-8b91-8feeb29d77cf/1bc563b0-d353-11ec-ada9-55bd22062331/file-1l35inazv.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l35inazs/a048151d-56b2-4eba-8b91-8feeb29d77cf/1bc563b0-d353-11ec-ada9-55bd22062331/file-1l35inazv.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>So, image (I<sub>1</sub>) formed is real, inverted and at a distance, v = 2f = 2 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.0